<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lead Experience Engineer at Publicis Sapient with 13+ years in software engineering, enterprise architecture, CMS platforms, and AI-assisted delivery."
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<p>
		I'm a Lead Experience Engineer within MENA PS at Publicis Sapient, where I've worked since 2015, bringing over 13 years of experience in software engineering and digital product development.
	</p>

	<p>
		My expertise spans the complete software development lifecycle, including enterprise architecture, scalable system design, and the development of secure, production-grade applications using React, Next.js, TypeScript, Node.js, and GraphQL. I also bring capabilities in analytics implementation, SEO optimisation, unit and end-to-end test automation, and enterprise design system development.
	</p>

	<p>
		I've worked across cloud and on-premise deployment environments with strong proficiency in AWS, DevOps practices, and CI/CD pipeline design and implementation. I have deep experience with enterprise CMS and digital experience platforms, including Adobe Experience Manager (AEM), Sitecore, headless CMS architectures, and e-commerce solutions.
	</p>

	<p>
		My hands-on AI engineering work includes agentic frameworks, large language model (LLM) integration, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), AI workflow automation, and intelligent application development using technologies such as N8N, Ollama, and Sapient Bodhi. Most recently I've led Spec-Driven Development — building the reusable components and framework assets that let AI tools such as Claude Code, Cursor, and Slingshot reliably deliver software from Figma designs and JIRA requirements. Anthropic Claude certifications complement this practical experience.
	</p>

	<p>
		As a technical leader, I focus on architecture definition, solution design, engineering governance, mentoring, stakeholder collaboration, and delivery oversight — enabling high-performing engineering teams and the successful execution of large-scale digital transformation initiatives across multiple industries.
	</p>
